 Pulma","he":"נונוגרם פיקסל תשבץ צלב","hu":"Nonogram Pixel Kereszt Puzzle","no":"Nonogram Pixel Kryss Puslespill","ro":"Nonogram Pixel Cruce Enigmă","sk":"Nonogram Pixel Kríž Hlavolam","sv":"Nonogram Pixel Kors Pussel"},"text_2":{"ar":"أنشئ لغزك الخاص ودع أصدقاءك يحلّونه","de":"Erstelle dein eigenes Rätsel und lass deine Freunde es lösen","en":"Create your own puzzle and let your friends solve it","es":"Crea tu propio rompecabezas y deja que tus amigos lo resuelvan","fr":"Crée ton propre puzzle et laisse tes amis le résoudre","hi":"अपनी खुद की पहेली बनाएं और दोस्तों को हल करने दें","id":"Buat teka-tekimu sendiri dan biarkan teman-temanmu menyelesaikannya","it":"Crea il tuo puzzle e lascia che i tuoi amici lo risolvano","ja":"自分だけのパズルを作って 友達に解いてもらおう","ko":"나만의 퍼즐을 만들고 친구들이 풀게 해보세요","nl":"Maak je eigen puzzel en laat je vrienden hem oplossen","pl":"Stwórz własną łamigłówkę i pozwól znajomym ją rozwiązać","pt":"Crie seu próprio quebra-cabeça e deixe seus amigos resolverem","ru":"Создай свою головоломку и предложи друзьям её решить","th":"สร้างปริศนาของคุณเอง และให้เพื่อน ๆ ช่วยแก้","tr":"Kendi bulmacanı yap ve arkadaşların çözsün","uk":"Створи власну головоломку та дай друзям її розв’язати","vi":"Tạo câu đố của riêng bạn và để bạn bè giải","zh-CN":"创建你自己的谜题 让朋友来解答","cs":"Vytvoř si vlastní hádanku a nech své přátele ji vyřešit","da":"Lav dit eget puslespil og lad dine venner løse det","fi":"Luo oma pulmasi ja anna ystäviesi ratkaista se","he":"צור את הפאזל שלך ותן לחברים שלך לפתור אותו","hu":"Készíts saját rejtvényt, és hagyd, hogy barátaid megoldják","no":"Lag ditt eget puslespill og la vennene dine løse det","ro":"Creează propriul tău puzzle și lasă-ți prietenii să-l rezolve","sk":"Vytvor si vlastnú hádanku a nechaj priateľov ju vyriešiť","sv":"Skapa ditt eget pussel och låt dina vänner lösa det"},"text_3":{"ar":"لغز جديد كل يوم","de":"Jeden Tag ein neues Rätsel","en":"A new puzzle every day","es":"Un nuevo rompecabezas cada día","fr":"Un nouveau puzzle chaque jour","hi":"हर दिन एक नई पहेली","id":"Teka-teki baru setiap hari","it":"Un nuovo puzzle ogni giorno","ja":"毎日 新しいパズル","ko":"매일 새로운 퍼즐","nl":"Elke dag een nieuwe puzzel","pl":"Nowa łamigłówka każdego dnia","pt":"Um novo quebra-cabeça todos os dias","ru":"Новая головоломка каждый день","th":"ปริศนาใหม่ ทุกวัน","tr":"Her gün yeni bir bulmaca","uk":"Нова головоломка щодня","vi":"Một câu đố mới mỗi ngày","zh-CN":"每天 一个新谜题","cs":"Nová hádanka každý den","da":"Et nyt puslespil hver dag","fi":"Uusi pulma joka päivä","he":"פאזל חדש בכל יום","hu":"Minden nap új rejtvény","no":"Et nytt puslespill hver dag","ro":"Un puzzle nou în fiecare zi","sk":"Nová hádanka každý deň","sv":"Ett nytt pussel varje dag"},"text_4":{"ar":"ألغاز ممتعة ولطيفة","de":"Spaßige und niedliche Rätsel","en":"Fun and cute puzzles","es":"Rompecabezas divertidos y adorables","fr":"Des puzzles amusants et mignons","hi":"मज़ेदार और प्यारी पहेलियाँ","id":"Teka-teki yang seru dan lucu","it":"Puzzle divertenti e carini","ja":"楽しくて かわいいパズル","ko":"재미있고 귀여운 퍼즐","nl":"Leuke en schattige puzzels","pl":"Zabawne i urocze łamigłówki","pt":"Quebra-cabeças divertidos e fofos","ru":"Весёлые и милые головоломки","th":"ปริศนา สนุกและน่ารัก","tr":"Eğlenceli ve şirin bulmacalar","uk":"Веселі та милі головоломки","vi":"Những câu đố vui nhộn và dễ thương","zh-CN":"有趣又可爱 的谜题","cs":"Zábavné a roztomilé hádanky","da":"Sjove og søde puslespil","fi":"Hauskoja ja suloisia pulmia","he":"פאזלים מהנים וחמודים","hu":"Szórakoztató és aranyos rejtvények","no":"Morsomme og søte puslespill","ro":"Puzzle-uri distractive și drăguțe","sk":"Zábavné a milé hádanky","sv":"Roliga och söta pussel"},"text_5":{"ar":"تصميم سلس وبسيط","de":"Flüssiges und minimalistisches Design","en":"Smooth and minimalist design","es":"Diseño fluido y minimalista","fr":"Design fluide et minimaliste","hi":"स्मूद और मिनिमल डिज़ाइन","id":"Desain yang mulus dan minimalis","it":"Design fluido e minimalista","ja":"スムーズで ミニマルなデザイン","ko":"부드럽고 미니멀한 디자인","nl":"Vloeiend en minimalistisch ontwerp","pl":"Płynny i minimalistyczny design","pt":"Design fluido e minimalista","ru":"Плавный и минималистичный дизайн","th":"ดีไซน์ ลื่นไหลและมินิมอล","tr":"Akıcı ve minimalist tasarım","uk":"Плавний і мінімалістичний дизайн","vi":"Thiết kế mượt mà và tối giản","zh-CN":"流畅简约 的设计","cs":"Plynulý a minimalistický design","da":"Flydende og minimalistisk design","fi":"Sulava ja minimalistinen suunnittelu","he":"עיצוב חלק ומינימליסטי","hu":"Letisztult és minimalista dizájn","no":"Flytende og minimalistisk design","ro":"Design fluid și minimalist","sk":"Plynulý a minimalistický dizajn","sv":"Smidig och minimalistisk design"},"text_6":{"ar":"خصص ألوان السمة","de":"Passe die Themenfarben an","en":"Customize theme colors","es":"Personaliza los colores del tema","fr":"Personnalise les couleurs du thème","hi":"थीम के रंग अनुकूलित करें","id":"Sesuaikan warna tema","it":"Personalizza i colori del tema","ja":"テーマカラーを カスタマイズ","ko":"테마 색상 사용자 지정","nl":"Pas themakleuren aan","pl":"Dostosuj kolory motywu","pt":"Personalize as cores do tema","ru":"Настрой цвета темы","th":"ปรับแต่ง สีธีม","tr":"Tema renklerini özelleştir","uk":"Налаштуйте кольори теми","vi":"Tùy chỉnh màu sắc chủ đề","zh-CN":"自定义 主题颜色","cs":"Přizpůsob si barvy motivu","da":"Tilpas temafarver","fi":"Mukauta teeman värejä","he":"התאם אישית את צבעי הערכה","hu":"Szabd testre a téma színeit","no":"Tilpass temafarger","ro":"Personalizează culorile temei","sk":"Prispôsob farby témy","sv":"Anpassa temafärger"}},"raw":"{\n  \"text_1\": {\n    \"ar\": \"لغز النونوغرام بالبكسل\",\n    \"de\": \"Nonogramm Pixel Kreuz Rätsel\",\n    \"en\": \"Nonogram Cross Pixel Puzzle\",\n    \"es\": \"Pixel Cruz Rompecabezas\",\n    \"fr\": \"Nonogramme Pixel Croisé Puzzle\",\n    \"hi\": \"नॉनोग्राम पिक्सेल क्रॉस पहेली\",\n    \"id\": \"Teka Teki Nonogram Pixel Silang\",\n    \"it\": \"Nonogramma Pixel Croce Puzzle\",\n    \"ja\": \"ノノグラムピクセルクロスパズル\",\n    \"ko\": \"노노그램 픽셀 크로스 퍼즐\",\n    \"nl\": \"Nonogram Pixel Kruis Puzzel\",\n    \"pl\